<title>USA: U.S. Enrichment Corp Q3 March 31 net decreases.</title>
<headline>U.S. Enrichment Corp Q3 March 31 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended   Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   March 31,		 March 31,</p>
<p>			    1997	    1996     1997	   1996</p>
<p>Revenue		 $216.4	 $311.2   $1,124.4	$991.8</p>
<p>Project development costs</p>
<p>			    32.6	   30.2	107.5	  65.9</p>
<p>Net income	     $15.1	  $48.7     $162.1	$221.7</p>
<p>					    (millions)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Project development costs primarily represent planned development and engineering spending activities for the future commercialization of uranium enrichment process.</p>
<p>As a U.S. government corporation, USEC is exempt from federal, state and local income taxes.</p>
</text>
